  "text": "Usage worn bracers\n\n---\nThese lovely armbands sparkle and gleam, reflecting your own incredible magnetism.\n\nImmanence (aura, mental) Others find it hard to leave your captivating presence. An aura surrounds you in a 10-foot emanation. An enemy in the aura that attempts to move away from you must succeed at a Will save save against your class DC or its move action is disrupted.\n\nTranscendence—Embrace of Destiny 1 (mental, spirit, transcendence)",
